From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Mecid <mecid@mecomediagroup.de>
Date: Mon, 2 Nov 2026 01:09:39 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] board: polyhex: imx8mp_debix_model_a: detect 2/4/8 GB LPDDR4

Mainline U-Boot supports only the 2 GB DEBIX Model A.

Port the DRAM detection from the vendor U-Boot
(debix-tech/uboot-nxp-debix lf_v2025.04-yocto-6.12.49-2.2.0).
SPL trains the five vendor timings in turn and matches the
MR5..MR8 ID. An unknown ID falls back to the first timing that
trains. U-Boot proper probes the DRAM size up to 8 GB.

All timings share one trained CSR list to keep SPL small.

Signed-off-by: Mecid <mecid@mecomediagroup.de>
